      <p class="text-primary-fixed-dim text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Building trust and securing futures through premium plotted developments across AP & TS since 1994.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h5 class="text-on-primary font-semibold mb-6">Quick Links</h5>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-primary-fixed-dim">
        <li class=""><a class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors" href="/about-us.html">About Us</a></li>
        <li class=""><a class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors" href="/projects.html">Our Projects</a></li>
        <li class=""><a class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors" href="/why-invest.html">Why Invest</a></li>
        <li class=""><a class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors" href="/growth-corridors.html">Growth Corridors</a></li>
        <li class=""><a class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors" href="/nri-corner.html">NRI Corner</a></li>
        <li class=""><a class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors" href="/contact-us.html">Contact Us</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h5 class="text-on-primary font-semibold mb-6">Legal</h5>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-primary-fixed-dim">
        <li class=""><a class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors" href="#">RERA Documentation</a></li>
        <li class=""><a class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors" href="#">Priv Policy</a></li>
        <li class=""><a class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors" href="#">Terms of Service</a></li>
        <li class=""><a class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors" href="#">Investment Risk Disclosure</a></li>
      </ul>
